{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547010/extras/59c30d425cfe8522fa295fd990a99328.poster.avif?t=1763902573\" width=1170 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547010/extras/59c30d425cfe8522fa295fd990a99328.webm?t=1763902573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waking up after an untold amount of time, you find yourself in the decaying remains of a vast, lifeless facility. Set in a <strong><i>Blame!</i>-esque</strong> world, you must navigate the depths of an <strong>abandoned megastructure</strong>\u2014a seemingly endless structure of ruins and corridors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through chained <strong>parkour </strong>movement, you traverse the crumbling infrastructure, exploring a desolate world long forgotten. But there is no one left to witness it but the massive iron structure.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547010/extras/0e9b5229afb0760d925859f87d957f71.avif?t=1763902573\" width=1200 height=200 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore &amp; traverse the vastness of the\u00a0<strong>Megastructure</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your way through spaces as small as ventilation shafts to giant rooms of which you cant even see the end</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the past and piece together the mysterious <strong>lore</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine classic\u00a0<strong>parkour</strong> with <strong>environmental puzzles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, Wallrun and Dash through the game...</p></li><l